      "statusChangeID": "639506b383369f2302e4722a",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "This was implemented in our latest patch! You can open your Quick Menu, click on someone, then click \"Invite to Group\".\n\nSelect the group you want to invite them to, and you're good to go.\n\nYou can also invite people from their main profile page.\n\nNote that in this version, *all* groups that you are a member of are listed in that menu, not just the ones you have permission to invite to. This is a technical limitation that we'll try our best to address later.",
